# Checksums of the SHARED headers — files that must be BYTE-IDENTICAL in every planet model:
# ATJUP, ATSAT, ATNEPT and ATURAN. All ELEVEN are present in all four; the porting that this
# header used to track the progress of is finished, and the lists of what had "still to come"
# are gone with it.
#
# There is no submodule and no symlink holding them together: symlinks are not safe here, because
# Synology Drive has silently reverted a working tree once already, and a submodule costs
# workflow friction on every clone. So the copies are plain files and THIS manifest is what makes
# a divergence loud instead of silent. `make check-shared` verifies it.
#
# Editing a shared header means: edit it in one repo, copy it to the other three, regenerate the
# changed line in ALL FOUR manifests (keeping this header), and rebuild each.
#
# NOTE, AND IT IS THE REASON TO READ THIS BEFORE TRUSTING A GREEN CHECK: `make check-shared`
# verifies a repo against ITS OWN manifest. It cannot see two repos holding DIFFERENT copies of
# the same shared header — that state has already occurred once, and both repos reported OK. The
# only thing that catches it is diffing the SHARED.md5 files of the repos against each other:
#
#     diff <(grep -E '^[0-9a-f]{32}' ../ATJUP/planet/SHARED.md5) \
#          <(grep -E '^[0-9a-f]{32}' planet/SHARED.md5)
#
# The checksum lines below are kept SORTED BY FILENAME in every repo precisely so that this is a
# plain diff with no sorting step to forget. With four models it matters more than it did with two.
#
# If keeping four copies in step ever becomes tedious enough to resent, that is the signal to
# promote them to a shared repository.
98cda0bd97bbc7a52556b97691e406c1  planet/ATPhys.h
31a2e16455e63d95654ac16bcf3b03b0  planet/BoundaryConditions.h
97a14dd488fb7fd821f87905bff64eaf  planet/ConvectiveAdjustment.h
97da55e01823b2dcba4426f038f05e79  planet/FluxLimiter.h
03b9170d1281bd85145ad79d1ca1da44  planet/ParaViewWriter.h
05e659b11ce6c48d2467dc8665fe54a3  planet/Precipitation.h
2d99410f30c42cc9aa83a8b0e76cd9a2  planet/PressureSolver.h
aed794d372dcce8daed3fe52dcc79e96  planet/Radiation.h
971cde804d42bdd9f3d55b6ee7802463  planet/Reporting.h
93fa345a3fb2b77a3a187d013916be32  planet/SaturationAdjustment.h
